fpconv
------------------------------------------
Minimalistic C / D implementation of Fabian Loitsch's Grisu-algorithm. Grisu
converts floating point numbers to an optimal decimal string representation
without loss of precision.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libfpconv-devel-0+git20231214-1bl2
  libfpconv0-0+git20231214-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/night-shift/fpconv

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/night-shift/fpconv.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack fpconv-0+git20231214-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./fpconv-0+git20231214-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/fpconv-0+git20231214-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/fpconv-0+git20231214-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfpconv0-0+git20231214-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfpconv-devel-0+git20231214-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(fpconv)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/fpconv.README
  /usr/share/doc/fpconv/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/fpconv/license

(libfpconv0)
  /usr/bin/cygfpconv-0.dll

(libfpconv-devel)
  /usr/include/fpconv.h
  /usr/lib/libfpconv.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/fpconv.pc

